WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Build up to a steady Forearm Stand (Pincha Mayurasana) against a wall.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Once stable, begin to bend the knees, drawing the heels toward the head.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Arch the upper back gently, letting the feet drift down and forward.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Keep the core engaged and the gaze steady to protect the low back.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Come out slowly, one controlled movement at a time.
